{"thread":{"threadID":2881,"boardID":208,"topic":"WHAT I DO??","time":1440271193,"userID":1941,"username":"battery","lastPostTime":1440359656,"lastPoster":"Mike","replies":14,"views":2287,"attachments":3,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":-1},"tags":[{"tagID":471,"name":"servers is good admins sucks"}],"posts":[{"postID":35651,"threadID":2881,"userID":1941,"username":"battery","subject":"WHAT I DO??","time":1440271193,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1440278689,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><strong>WHAT I DO?</strong><br><strong>WHAT I DO?</strong><br><strong><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php/User/1758/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Vengeance</a> what i doing wrong youu needed to ban me????</strong></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35652,"threadID":2881,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1440271851,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1440301040,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>This is a well written complaint, I request the immediate kick of Vengeance from the Admin team.<br>Just kidding.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>No one is going to take you serious, file a proper complaint or you won&#x27;t get unbanned. I wouldn&#x27;t unban you, I&#x27;m sure Vengeance has done the right thing.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35653,"threadID":2881,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1440271971,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>dude. seriously. u are spamming the server again. <a href=\"http://bans.dream-community.de/index.php?p=banlist&amp;amp;searchText=STEAM_1%3A1%3A36656212&amp;amp;Submit=Search\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\