) times spamming the ingame chat, because everytime you tried to connect, there was a 4-line chat message about you. So i increased the ban to 3 days because ofthe fact that oyu are spamming the chat</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Please get your facts right when complaining about me. I saw your ban protest but the stuff you wrote there simply was &quot;bullshit&quot;. I didnt ban oyu because of the fact i was spawnkilling or something.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Im am not intending to delete your ban, so have a great day and game(but not on our servers for the next 3 days)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sincerly yours,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Vengeance</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>EDIT: Nice pic you got there, its amusing me</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35656,"threadID":2881,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1440272991,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1440274013,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1430-mar1o/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@mar1o :)</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1445-freak/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@FREAK</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a><br>Bitte closen, die Diskussion ist sinnlos und führt nirgendwo hin. Am besten noch den Spieler vom Forum ausschließen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35659,"threadID":2881,"userID":1941,"username":"battery","subject":"","time":1440277789,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[{"attachmentID":646,"objectID":35659,"filename":"Hey_ca5a51_500684.png","filesize":727606,"fileType":"image/png","isImage":1,"width":780,"h